    <h1>Making the Hover&nbsp;Bike</h1>
    <p class="standfirst">How a concept painting became a textured, lit and animated real-time asset in Unreal Engine&nbsp;4, and the decisions that shaped it along the way.</p>
    <dl class="bd-meta">
      <div><dt>Concept</dt><dd><a href="https://emiliograsso.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Emilio Grasso</a></dd></div>
      <div><dt>Parts</dt><dd>97</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Triangles</dt><dd>52,753</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Tools</dt><dd>3ds Max · ZBrush · Topogun · Substance · Photoshop · UE4</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </header>

  <div class="bd-body wrap">
    <nav class="bd-toc" aria-label="Chapters">
